Package: hitPredictorR
Type: Package
Title: Predict Song Hit Potential Using Audio Features
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Kyana Hay
Maintainer: Kyana Hay <kmhay@usf.edu>
Description: An R package that predicts the likelihood of a song becoming a hit using a multi-factor scoring system based on Spotify audio features such as energy, danceability, valence, popularity, loudness, tempo, speechiness, instrumentalness, and explicit content.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports:
    ggplot2
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
